WEBVTT

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.360
When I found you

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.880
I saw raw

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.820
untamed power

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.360
and beyond that

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.800
something truly special

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.100
something

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.940
inside me has always been there

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.340
then I was awake

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.300
and I need help

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.960
I've seen this raw strength only once before

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.900
It didn't scare me enough then

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.780
It does now

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:08.240
Let the past die

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.720
Kill it

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.440
If you have to

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.940
That's the only way to become what you are meant to be

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.140
We are the spark

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.480
that will light the fire

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.180
that will burn the First Order down

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.220
Come on!

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.540
This is not going to go

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.460
the way you think

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:53.300
Fulfill

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.600
your

00:01:58.620 --> 00:01:59.620
destiny.

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:05.340
I need someone

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.960
to show me my place in all this